    "title": "Three Counties: Bikepacking Western Oregon (Video) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "bikepacking.com\nwebsite\nYamhill\nThree Counties: Bikepacking Western Oregon (Video)\nBy Guest,\n14 hours agoIn June, I cycled from Yamhill, Oregon, into the Tillamook State Forest for an overnight bikepacking trip, solo camping by the Trask River. The route was scouted ahead of time and is well-documented, featuring 89 percent gravel and unpaved roads that take riders into the backroads of Yamhill, Washington, and Tillamook counties, around the Barney Reservoir, and up to some incredible ridgelines revealing a variety of beautiful views (even in logging country).",
